Rāma asks Vibhīṣaṇa about the mountain like crowned giant --- Vibhīṣaṇa names Kumbhakarṇa scourge of gods and demons --- Kumbhakarṇa devoured thousands until Indra struck him with vajra --- Kumbhakarṇa smote Indra with Airāvata tusk in return --- Brahmā cursed him to sleep six months and wake one day --- Rāvaṇa woke him in distress against Rāma --- Nīla arrays monkeys with peaks trees rocks at Laṅkā gates